Z||000034||FieroMaster88||02-19-2001||01:00 AM||||My other hobby, first being my Fiero, is the whole import tuning thing.  The quickest car I have ever been in is a Mitsubishi Eclipse GSX.  We beat a new GT Mustang in it.  I am more of a 4 cyl person and I know what some of the imports can do.  My plan is to build a Quad 4 Fiero to beat all of them around here.  They have all the Type R stickers on them, huge ass spoilers, clear marker lights.  Stupid stuff like that.  This guy always talks trash about my Fiero and he drives a Nissan pulsar!   Kids like that make me mad, but putting some money into your motor in an import is great.  It is amazing the power you can get from 4 cyliners.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">       <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/net4/smiling2.gif">  <BR>84 Indy Fiero (restoration Project)  <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/3dlil/eek2.gif"> ||||reg||1
